<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final at the Romanian Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat 3-Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-1 7-6 (7-5)</p>
